{"id":"n54843-1-9","stage":2,"title":"먼지 · 灰尘","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54843-1-9-1","ko":"네 방 청소는 좀 스스로 해라. 책상에 먼지가 수북하잖니!","zh":"你的房间自己打扫一下吧。桌子上积了厚厚的灰尘呢！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"방","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}},{"text":"청소는","meaning":"打扫，清扫，扫除","explanation":"청소：打扫，清扫，扫除；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"청소","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32789","senseId":"1","lemma":"청소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청소는","audio":"/audio/2dea930f03ffa9a1100a.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"스스로","meaning":"自己，亲自","explanation":"스스로：自己，亲自","readings":[{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62476","senseId":"1","lemma":"스스로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"스스로","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3"}},{"text":"해라.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해라","audio":"/audio/fa4a66f34ce12706f1b3.mp3"}},{"text":"책상에","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책상에","audio":"/audio/857c9dcfc1b6ee935b30.mp3"}},{"text":"먼지가","meaning":"灰尘","explanation":"먼지：灰尘；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"먼지","audio":"/audio/b1dc28aab0e945184eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54843","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼지가","audio":"/audio/ea469b649835e34f56c5.mp3"}},{"text":"수북하잖니!","meaning":"满满，满鼓鼓","explanation":"수북하다：满满，满鼓鼓；잖니：提醒听者双方已知的事实，带反问或确认语气：“不是……吗”。","readings":[{"term":"수북하다","audio":"/audio/b930287284cc53abdbd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83446","senseId":"1","lemma":"수북하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수북하잖니","audio":"/audio/1168b9fc0285ade71b35.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"8049e4b9139d36bf","term":"청소","zh":"打扫，清扫，扫除","audio":"/audio/8049e4b9139d36bf5db4.mp3","entryId":"32789","definition":"清除肮脏杂乱的东西。","pronunciation":["청소"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"53445f4fae94053b","term":"스스로","zh":"自己，亲自","audio":"/audio/53445f4fae94053b5caa.mp3","entryId":"62476","definition":"不接受别人的帮助，依靠自己的力量。","pronunciation":["스스로"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","def